{"about_the_game":"EON Fighter is a space action game. The mission is to gather resources while resisting enemy attacks. Once you complete your load, a friendly ship will come to take your minerals so you can continue with the task.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2152850/extras/Secuencia_01_1.gif?t=1691862034\" /><br><br>As you destroy enemies you can level up and improve your ship, more shield, speed, damage, bullet speed, etc.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2152850/extras/Secuencia_01.gif?t=1691862034\" /><br><br>Each time you deliver, you'll receive new secondary weapons, or major upgrades that will help you withstand increasing enemy attacks. It will also give you money to buy new ships and permanent upgrades.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2152850/extras/Secuencia_01_2.gif?t=1691862034\" />","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2152850?t=1691862034","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2152850?t=1691862034","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2152850/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1691862034","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2152850/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1691862034","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"EON Fighter is a space action game. The mission is to gather resources while resisting enemy attacks. Once you complete your load, a friendly ship will come to take your minerals so you can continue with the task.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asse